OL,5,MCROYAL MARINES BARRACKS BLAST KILLS 10
OL,6, FIRA claims responsjbility.....103B203
OL,7, FIRA claims responsibility.....103B204
OL,8, FThe Queen "deeply shocked"....104B204
OL,9,F Emergency phone numbers.......105B205
OL,10,C IRA renews mainland campaign..190 BBC1
OL,11,Spppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
OL,12,C
OL,13,CBELFASTFFiles on 60 terrorist
OL,14,F suspects sent to newspaper....113B213
OL,16,CLEBANONFAoun agrees peace plan.110B210
OL,17,C
OL,18,CAMBULANCEFpay talks break down.109B209
OL,19,FF
OL,20,CRIOTSFsenior policeman charged.115B215
OL,21,F
