PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F118A1790107426
OL,1,  V<,,4<,,4<,,4Spp0pp0p``0pp0      G8/17
OL,2,T]V5b(55b(55j5Sj5.%jj5/l4
OL,3, V -,,%-,,%-,,%S#"!##!###!##!
OL,5, Talks between the ambulance unions and
OL,6,Ghealth service representatives over pay
OL,7, have broken down without agreement.
OL,9,FThe two sides met this morning for the
OL,10,Ffirst time since the ban on overtime
OL,11,Fand rest-day working began last week.
OL,13,FThe unions want a pay rise of more than
OL,14,F11%. They have been offered 6.5%.
OL,16,FA union spokesman accused health
OL,17,Fservice managers of "pulling a stunt"
OL,18,Fin calling the meeting and not making
OL,19,Fa new offer.
OL,23,T]CFrom 22-09-89   teletextarchive.com
OL,24,ANext PageBT'text FilesCRewindFReg Radio
FL,119,180,120,250,0,100
PN,11809
SC,0009
CT,25,T
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F118A1790107426
OL,1,  V<,,4<,,4<,,4Spp0pp0p``0pp0      G9/17
OL,2,T]V5b(55b(55j5Sj5.%jj5/l4
OL,3, V -,,%-,,%-,,%S#"!##!###!##!
OL,5,GSenior Scotland Yard officer Detective
OL,6,NChief Superintendent Graham Melvin is
OL,7,Gto face disciplinary charges.
OL,8,G
OL,9,FThey arise from the inquiry into the
OL,10,Fmurder of PC Keith Blakelock in the
OL,11,FBroadwater Farm riot in Tottenham four
OL,12,Fyears ago.
OL,13,F
OL,14,FMr Melvin, who is now head of the
OL,15,FYard's organised crime task force, was
OL,16,Fa key figure in the inquiry.
OL,18,FThree men were convicted of the murder
OL,19,Fat the Old Bailey and jailed for life.
OL,20,FThe judge criticised the police over
OL,21,Fthe questioning of a 13-year-old boy.
OL,23,D]CFrom 22-09-89   teletextarchive.com
